  "description": "The Super X electric bike, powered by a UL2859-certified 48V 15Ah battery pack, delivers unparalleled performance with a range of 45-70 miles per charge. enabling extended travel without frequent recharging.\nThe bike's integrated battery design ensures a seamless and efficient riding experience, while its IPX5 waterproof rating provides robust protection against water ingress. This feature guarantees resilience in various weather conditions, making it an ideal choice for adventurous riders.\nEquipped with a PEAK 1500W brushless motor, 20\" fat tires, and dual suspension paired with hydraulic brakes, the Super X offers exceptional power and control. Its 7-speed transmission and three riding modes, including manual, cater to diverse terrains and riding styles, making it versatile for both casual cruisers and serious adventurers. With these features, the Super X electric bike stands out as a reliable and high-performance option for adult riders",
